  - statementId: 2
    basicConversation:
    - id: 0
      conversation: 'I used to be the manager who used to run this place. Back then, I was pitying myself too much did not do my job. I mean I did not want to devote my whole life here at this place. Why? Um.. My dream was not this. I was having hard time getting hold of myself and the high officials have gave me a few months vacation. When I cam back, this place had changed a lot as if time had went fast only in this place.. Something bad must had been done. It was only a few years.. '
